<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-acropora-millepora-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Acropora millepora Holocene Turing wavenumber at 385.2 µm (pass 2) — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each modelling step is a named function with the source relation in its docstring: jacobian, sigma_of_h, peak_wavelength, murray_center_um, integrate, dominant_wavelength_um, choose_dihedral, orientation_ks. The 385.2 µm assignment is labeled as a slot scale in the module docstring." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acropora-millepora-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acropora-millepora-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-acropora-millepora-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Acropora millepora Holocene Turing wavenumber at 385.2 µm (pass 2) — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The PDE, Jacobian, dispersion, and D_u bisection are unchanged and match Turing 1952 / Schnakenberg 1979 as stated in the docstring. k_c is argmax σ, and murray_center_um is a separate, shorter wavelength (319.4 µm). The remaining gap is that 385.2 µm is assigned by the slot rather than read from a pigment-spacing table." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acropora-millepora-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acropora-millepora-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-acropora-millepora-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Acropora millepora Holocene Turing wavenumber at 385.2 µm (pass 2) — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "FFT wavelength 383.573 µm versus reference 385.2 µm. Sweep RMSE 4.06 µm and Pearson r 0.999986 versus an ideal r of 1. Specimen coherency 0.427 versus render coherency 0.722, foreground 0.550 versus 0.558, orientation KS 0.054 versus 0. These are not self-referential copies. Nominal D_u is still tuned, which is why the score is 88 rather than the high 90s." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
